        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions TTLB-8.5  Lighting Bolt Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe amazing new designed shower door pull is constructed of 3/8\" thick, highest quality solid brass. Finished  in your choice of Satin Nickel,  Polished Chrome, Polished Nickel, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Polished Brass or Antique Brass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese Lighting Bolt  design shower door pulls are hand crafted in the USA by First Impressions.  The mounting brackets can be repositioned  to fit your specific application.  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a> with your requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions SD-TTLB-8.5 Modern Lighting Bolt Shower Door Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 6\" C/C (distance between the 2 mounting holes)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 6</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pulls and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
